IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTVAL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY CUSTREC.
       01 WS-DATE-RC PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 LK-CUST-REC PIC X(120).
       01 LK-RC PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-CUST-REC LK-RC.
       MAIN.
           MOVE 0 TO LK-RC
           IF LK-CUST-REC(1:10) = SPACES MOVE 8 TO LK-RC END-IF
           CALL 'DATEVAL' USING WS-DATE-RC
           IF WS-DATE-RC NOT = 0 MOVE 8 TO LK-RC END-IF
           GOBACK.
